# Density Compare
# Phosphorus (P) — real density 1.823 g/cm³. equal masses: Phosphorus vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Phosphorus Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 16.4mm color: #ff8000 at (-20mm, 8.2mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 14.5 g — the water cube is the reference
